Starlink is set to become the third company to get a global mobile personal communication by satellite services (GMPCS) license in India, after OneWeb and Jio. 🇮🇳📡

According to an ET Satcom report, the company is expected to be eligible to offer Internet access to individual customers and organisations in India, after completion of a security check. 
